  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "2. Add the chopped onion and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "3. Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "4. Add the chopped cabbage and cook until wilted, about 5 minutes.",
    "5. Add the pilaf mix and stir to combine.",
